[
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 0.72,
    "end": 6.54,
    "transcript": "How did you find this place? I lived here for four years, Colorado that is, didn't"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 6.54,
    "end": 10.74,
    "transcript": "know this place existed. Found it at a college fair, was drawn to it because all"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 10.74,
    "end": 15.34,
    "transcript": "these other colleges had tables. This one had a scared little girl sitting in a"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 15.34,
    "end": 21.18,
    "transcript": "corner with a bucket and a piece of plywood on top. So I walk up to it, curious of"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 21.18,
    "end": 26.84,
    "transcript": "course, pick up the little construction paper and crayon pamphlet, look at the"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 26.84,
    "end": 33.8,
    "transcript": "tuition bill and I'm like, ah, this is where I'm going. But yeah, as soon as I was in the"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 33.8,
    "end": 36.28,
    "transcript": "industry I actually looked at the video for this place commercial. Have any of you"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 36.28,
    "end": 39.78,
    "transcript": "ever noticed that in the commercial for this place there's no pictures of the"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 39.78,
    "end": 44.9,
    "transcript": "actual campus? We've got the fountain and that's it. That is like our perk right there. And I"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 44.9,
    "end": 48.44,
    "transcript": "got here and I realized why. You can tell this place was built during the Cold War."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 48.44,
    "end": 52.56,
    "transcript": "Everything's looked like the bunker. I was surprised, I was actually expecting to"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 52.56,
    "end": 55.12,
    "transcript": "see the president standing somewhere all in camouflage with the helmet on"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 55.12,
    "end": 56.84,
    "transcript": "waiting, come on attack Russia."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 56.84,
    "end": 64.28,
    "transcript": "I dare you. But yeah, the art building is definitely the worst. I've never seen an"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 64.28,
    "end": 68.46,
    "transcript": "art building before with absolutely no windows on it. It's like, yeah, we want to"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 68.46,
    "end": 76.84,
    "transcript": "paint your pictures but we really don't want anyone to see them. We're a little self-conscious."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 76.84,
    "end": 80.9,
    "transcript": "I have to give the art majors crap. Because if you're gonna piss off a group of people on campus, it has to be the art"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 80.9,
    "end": 83.54,
    "transcript": "majors. Because when they come and vandalize your house at 2 in the"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 83.54,
    "end": 85.68,
    "transcript": "morning, it always looks so nice."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 86.84,
    "end": 92.22,
    "transcript": "I mean, show up, it's more like, if you got redecorated, then really you got tagged."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 92.22,
    "end": 100.94,
    "transcript": "Just make sure you don't piss off the abstract art majors, because then it only looks good when you have to squint at it."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 100.94,
    "end": 105.86,
    "transcript": "I mean, abstract art majors, can you really be proud of your art if you"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 105.86,
    "end": 108.86,
    "transcript": "actually have to close your eyes more to make it look good?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 108.86,
    "end": 115.56,
    "transcript": "That's not a joke here. The reason we all came to camp is cafeteria food."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 116.84,
    "end": 122.84,
    "transcript": "Oh, you know, there's just something about a cafeteria where it tastes like all the meat had a common ancestor."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 127.84,
    "end": 129.84,
    "transcript": "Brings it out right there."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 129.84,
    "end": 132.84,
    "transcript": "And you're looking at the meatloaf, and you're not wondering what animal it came from,"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 132.84,
    "end": 134.84,
    "transcript": "you're just hoping it has some kind of actual meat in it."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 134.84,
    "end": 136.84,
    "transcript": "That it was alive at some point."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 138.84,
    "end": 139.84,
    "transcript": "Anyway."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 139.84,
    "end": 143.84,
    "transcript": "I've been getting a little skeptical about my major lately, because I'm a mechatronics major."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 143.84,
    "end": 145.84,
    "transcript": "I've never heard of this major before."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 145.84,
    "end": 147.84,
    "transcript": "So, like you said, my name is Steven Herrera."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 147.84,
    "end": 150.84,
    "transcript": "If you can tell by my last name, I'm not white."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 150.84,
    "end": 152.84,
    "transcript": "I am Latino."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 152.84,
    "end": 153.84,
    "transcript": "I don't look like it."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 153.84,
    "end": 157.84,
    "transcript": "And despite what my birth certificate says, no two Mexican-Americans can have a white kid."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 158.84,
    "end": 160.84,
    "transcript": "Of course, I guess if it was..."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 160.84,
    "end": 162.84,
    "transcript": "I was born in Texas, San Antonio."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 162.84,
    "end": 167.84,
    "transcript": "And so, I guess if they actually wrote it the way that they talked down there,"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 167.84,
    "end": 169.84,
    "transcript": "it would have said, man, this fool is white."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 169.84,
    "end": 171.84,
    "transcript": "This kid is white down here."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 171.84,
    "end": 172.84,
    "transcript": "Right there."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 173.84,
    "end": 174.84,
    "transcript": "But it was really bad."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 175.84,
    "end": 179.84,
    "transcript": "Actually, when I was born, my own grandparents didn't recognize me."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 179.84,
    "end": 182.84,
    "transcript": "They didn't think I was my parents' son."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 182.84,
    "end": 184.84,
    "transcript": "I was in the elevator with them."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 184.84,
    "end": 190.84,
    "transcript": "And it even said Herrera on my baby basket buggy bumper deal."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 190.84,
    "end": 193.84,
    "transcript": "And they're still like, that's not him."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 193.84,
    "end": 195.84,
    "transcript": "That is not my child."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 195.84,
    "end": 197.84,
    "transcript": "That is not my grandchild."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 197.84,
    "end": 202.84,
    "transcript": "Both my abuelas, they're both Spanish old ladies."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 202.84,
    "end": 205.84,
    "transcript": "And they're still kicking at 95, somewhat."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 205.84,
    "end": 209.84,
    "transcript": "But, you know, and so they're asking, no, that can't be him."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 209.84,
    "end": 210.84,
    "transcript": "He's white."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 210.84,
    "end": 211.84,
    "transcript": "He's a white boy."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 211.84,
    "end": 212.84,
    "transcript": "A little white boy."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 212.84,
    "end": 214.84,
    "transcript": "That's not my grandson."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 216.84,
    "end": 222.84,
    "transcript": "And then they came to my dad and my mom, you know, and they're like,"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 222.84,
    "end": 225.84,
    "transcript": "mijo, he is not our grandson."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 225.84,
    "end": 226.84,
    "transcript": "Where is our grandson?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 226.84,
    "end": 228.84,
    "transcript": "Get the right one here."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 228.84,
    "end": 230.84,
    "transcript": "No, mom, this is him."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 230.84,
    "end": 232.84,
    "transcript": "This is your grandson."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 232.84,
    "end": 234.84,
    "transcript": "You're like, but he's white."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 234.84,
    "end": 236.84,
    "transcript": "Why is he so white?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 236.84,
    "end": 238.84,
    "transcript": "And I actually go here."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 238.84,
    "end": 241.84,
    "transcript": "It's been different than what I expected, you know."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 241.84,
    "end": 243.84,
    "transcript": "I'm going to get the curriculum here."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 243.84,
    "end": 245.84,
    "transcript": "What do you guys think?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 245.84,
    "end": 247.84,
    "transcript": "Pretty challenging, huh?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 247.84,
    "end": 249.84,
    "transcript": "Stand as they stand."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 249.84,
    "end": 253.12,
    "transcript": "I mean, I'm struggling."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 253.12,
    "end": 254.12,
    "transcript": "I'm going to be honest."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 254.12,
    "end": 255.12,
    "transcript": "I'm struggling here."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 255.12,
    "end": 261.77,
    "transcript": "Look at one of my textbooks here."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 261.77,
    "end": 269.45,
    "transcript": "Scooby doo, where are you?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 269.45,
    "end": 274.62,
    "transcript": "No, this is not MIT."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 274.62,
    "end": 275.62,
    "transcript": "This is not Harvard."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 275.62,
    "end": 278.62,
    "transcript": "Okay, we should not be held to a standard higher than anyone else in this nation."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 280.62,
    "end": 282.62,
    "transcript": "That's really the only complaint I have."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 282.62,
    "end": 283.62,
    "transcript": "I mean, what do you say?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 283.62,
    "end": 285.62,
    "transcript": "There's nothing else to complain about."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 285.62,
    "end": 286.62,
    "transcript": "It's a great place."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 286.62,
    "end": 287.62,
    "transcript": "You've got a beautiful campus."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 287.62,
    "end": 289.62,
    "transcript": "Knowledgeable instructors."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 289.62,
    "end": 291.62,
    "transcript": "Beautiful language and ample parking."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 293.62,
    "end": 295.62,
    "transcript": "I've got some more complaints."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 295.62,
    "end": 300.62,
    "transcript": "Here at CSU Provo, there's a wide variety of students."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 300.62,
    "end": 304.62,
    "transcript": "You have your old students, your young students, and all the other kinds."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 304.62,
    "end": 307.62,
    "transcript": "I'm going to go back to the non-traditional standpoint."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 307.62,
    "end": 312.62,
    "transcript": "Also, how do you know that you have a non-traditional student in your class?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 312.62,
    "end": 314.62,
    "transcript": "They know every answer."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 314.62,
    "end": 315.62,
    "transcript": "Raise their hands."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 315.62,
    "end": 316.62,
    "transcript": "This is how it is."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 316.62,
    "end": 320.62,
    "transcript": "And then the professor usually, respectively, says, yeah."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 320.62,
    "end": 322.62,
    "transcript": "Anyway, let's go on to the next answer."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 322.62,
    "end": 325.62,
    "transcript": "I mean, honestly, who has a non-traditional student in their class that does not know every answer?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 325.62,
    "end": 326.62,
    "transcript": "Do people?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 326.62,
    "end": 327.62,
    "transcript": "Honestly, be honest."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 327.62,
    "end": 331.62,
    "transcript": "Does every non-traditional student seem to know the answer for every question possible?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 331.62,
    "end": 332.62,
    "transcript": "Yes."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 332.62,
    "end": 333.62,
    "transcript": "Honestly, I'm struggling."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 333.62,
    "end": 335.62,
    "transcript": "Seriously, driving me nuts."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 335.62,
    "end": 337.62,
    "transcript": "Who likes it here?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 337.62,
    "end": 338.62,
    "transcript": "Who likes it here?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 338.62,
    "end": 340.62,
    "transcript": "Who likes it here at CSU Provo?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 340.62,
    "end": 342.62,
    "transcript": "Some random reasons why you like it here."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00104",
    "start": 342.62,
